elaxed","children":"Assessment and Plan are the provider's clinical judgment — know where your contribution ends"}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-engl-ink-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-engl-care-600","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Relevant versus irrelevant information: a note that includes everything hides what matters"}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-engl-ink-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-engl-care-600","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Documentation sequence: information in a predictable order can be read quickly under pressure"}]]}]]}]]}]
